  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2984229311066112
    m_Localized: (se) Extraction point activated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2984229336231936
    m_Localized: (se) Extraction point completed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2984229336231937
    m_Localized: (se) Fill the extraction point with valuables
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2984229336231938
    m_Localized: (se) Avoid the grenades!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2984229336231939
    m_Localized: (se) Find the next extraction point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2984229336231940
    m_Localized: (se) Get back to the truck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442524647424
    m_Localized: (se) Good job!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813248
    m_Localized: (se) Use [move] to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813249
    m_Localized: (se) Move to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813250
    m_Localized: (se) Use [move] on your keyboard until the progress bar is filled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813251
    m_Localized: (se) Press [jump] to jump.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813252
    m_Localized: (se) Jump to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813253
    m_Localized: (se) Press [jump] to do jumps until the progress bar is filled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813254
    m_Localized: (se) Press [crouch] to sneak. Monsters are less likely to see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813255
    m_Localized: (se) Sneak to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813256
    m_Localized: (se) Hold [crouch] and use [move] until the progess is filled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813257
    m_Localized: (se) Use [crouch] to sneak under stuff and hide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813258
    m_Localized: (se) Hide to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813259
    m_Localized: (se) Hold [crouch] and walk in under a prop, stay there until you
      fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813260
    m_Localized: (se) Hold down [sprint] to sprint. This drains your energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813261
    m_Localized: (se) Sprint to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813262
    m_Localized: (se) Hold [sprint] and use [move] to sprint until you filled the
      progress bar! If the energy runs out, wait for it to regenerate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813263
    m_Localized: (se) Run and press [tumble] to fall with style. Jumping also helps!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813264
    m_Localized: (se) Run, jump and fall to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813265
    m_Localized: (se) Run with [sprint], jump with [jump] and press [tumble] to throw
      yourself. Do it until you fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813266
    m_Localized: (se) Grab objects using [grab].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813267
    m_Localized: (se) Carry that thing to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813268
    m_Localized: (se) Press and hold [grab] on an object until you fill the progress
      bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813269
    m_Localized: (se) Use [push] to alter the distance of grabbed objects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813270
    m_Localized: (se) Alter the distance of a grabbed item!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813271
    m_Localized: (se) Press and hold [grab] on an object and use [push] to alter
      the distance of the item you grabbed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813272
    m_Localized: (se) Rotate grabbed objects using [grab2].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813273
    m_Localized: (se) Rotate stuff to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813274
    m_Localized: (se) While holding an object with [grab], press and hold [grab2]
      and move your aim to rotate it. Rotate until you fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813275
    m_Localized: (se) Grab and press [interact] to toggle items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813276
    m_Localized: (se) Toggle that thing on and off!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813277
    m_Localized: (se) Grab the ball with [grab] and toggle it on and off using [interact]
      until you fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813278
    m_Localized: (se) Grab an Item and use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3]
      to put it in your inventory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813279
    m_Localized: (se) Fill your entire inventory!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813280
    m_Localized: (se) While holding an item with [grab], press [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3].
      Fill all spots in your inventory to complete the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813281
    m_Localized: (se) Use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3] to take items out
      of your inventory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813282
    m_Localized: (se) Empty your entire inventory!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813283
    m_Localized: (se) Use [inventory1]/[inventory2]/[inventory3] and empty all spots
      to fill the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813284
    m_Localized: (se) Use [map] to view the map. The map is <b><u>IMPORTANT</u></b>
      for navigation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442549813285
    m_Localized: (se) Check the map!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201856
    m_Localized: (se) Hold down [map] and view it until you have filled the progress
      bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201857
    m_Localized: (se) This is a C.A.R.T. Grab it by the handle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201858
    m_Localized: (se) Walk around with the C.A.R.T. a little!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201859
    m_Localized: (se) Grab the C.A.R.T. by the handle with [grab] and walk around
      with it until you have filled the progress bar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201860
    m_Localized: (se) Fill C.A.R.T.s with valuables. C.A.R.T.s are <b><u>IMPORTANT</u></b>
      for carrying more stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201861
    m_Localized: (se) Fill the C.A.R.T. with valuables!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201862
    m_Localized: (se) Put three items into the C.A.R.T.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201863
    m_Localized: (se) Activate and fill <b><u>EXTRACTION POINTS</u></b> with valuables.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201864
    m_Localized: (se) Extract the valuables!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201865
    m_Localized: (se) HELLO! FILL THE <b><u>EXTRACTION POINT</u></b> WITH VALUABLES!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201866
    m_Localized: (se) Enter the <b><u>TRUCK</u></b> and send a message to your boss
      in order to leave a level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201867
    m_Localized: (se) Get into the truck and send a message!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201868
    m_Localized: (se) Walk into the truck, grab and hold the message area on the
      truck screen with [grab] to send a message!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201869
    m_Localized: (se) Share your health with other players by grabbing their necks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201870
    m_Localized: (se) Revive other players by extracting their heads!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201871
    m_Localized: (se) Buy <b><u>POWER CRYSTALS</u></b> for the <b><u>CHARGING STATION</u></b>
      to recharge and repair your gear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201872
    m_Localized: (se) Only one <b><u>EXTRACTION POINT</u></b> can be active at a
      time, find the current one using your map!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201873
    m_Localized: (se) Press [chat] to open the chat! It's fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201874
    m_Localized: (se) Time to leave, the truck heals you and revives carried player
      heads!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201875
    m_Localized: (se) This level has multiple <b><u>EXTRACTION POINTS</u></b>, you
      must clear them all to leave!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201876
    m_Localized: (se) This is the <b><u>SHOP</u></b>, extract items to purchase.
      No harm lasts here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201877
    m_Localized: (se) Use [expression1]/[expression2]/[expression3]/[expression4]/[expression5]/[expression6]
      to make expressions. You can even mix!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201878
    m_Localized: (se) Grabbing an enemy will now cause overcharge, when full you
      get blasted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201879
    m_Localized: (se) Multiple people will dampen the overcharge effect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201880
    m_Localized: (se) While dead your head charges, use that charge to briefly possess
      your head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201881
    m_Localized: (se) While possessing your head, hold [jump] to jump. Hold to jump
      higher at a greater cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18554442558201882
    m_Localized: KLAPPA HUNDEN!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22956499448881152
    m_Localized: (se) [menu] to skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23598574554132480
    m_Localized: "Fyll <b><u>UTVINNINGSPLATSEN</u></b> med v\xE4rdesaker."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23609344067186688
    m_Localized: "Detta \xE4r en <b><u>SK\xD6NHETSL\xC5DA</u></b>, utvinn den f\xF6r
      en bel\xF6ning."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23609344088158208
    m_Localized: "Om den skadas s\xE5 kan du <b><u>l\xE4ka</u></b> den med din egen
      h\xE4lsa."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23623549780570112
    m_Localized: "Stoppa in <b><u>SKATTEPOLETTER</u></b> i butiksmaskinen f\xF6r
      att f\xE5 dina bel\xF6ningar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23920995436847104
    m_Localized: (se) FOCUS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25797701263065088
    m_Localized: (se) Buy stuff in the shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25797701284036608
    m_Localized: (se) Enjoy the ride, recharge stuff and GEAR UP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25822090339713024
    m_Localized: "Tryck [interact] f\xF6r att stoppa in skattepolletten"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
